8. Tollbooth Quality Test

A strong Tollbooth exhibits:

Necessity\uparrow

Substitutability\downarrow

Traffic\uparrow

Capture\uparrow

Bypassability\downarrow

Durability\uparrow

WinnerDependence\downarrow

Compactly:

Quality_T
=
\frac{
Necessity
\times TrafficGrowth
\times Capture
\times Durability
}{
Substitutability
\times Bypassability
\times WinnerDependence
}

This is a conceptual scoring function, not a validated financial formula.

